{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Fulfillment Center Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3182990,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your uncle has left you in charge of his Fulfillment center while he jet's off to who knows where!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with $10,000 and a pallet of salt, you're a highly important link in the local supply line!\u00a0 Your uncle left you with direct connections to various suppliers and a couple of clients that need your help!\u00a0 <br><br>Organize orders from Clients, manage your Fulfillment centers inventory, and make sure the shipments are sent on time in Fulfillment Center Simulator!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Warehouse</strong> \u2013 Start with a single pallet and grow into a fulfillment powerhouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Process &amp; Ship Orders</strong> \u2013 Pick, pack, and deliver shipments efficiently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Pallet Handling</strong> \u2013 Stack, wrap, and manage pallets with physics-based mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Automate</strong> \u2013 Invest in equipment to boost efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Your Business</strong> \u2013 Track expenses, profits, and customer renown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Layout</strong> \u2013 Organize shelves, workstations, and storage areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games &amp; Challenges</strong> \u2013 Engage in interactive tasks like pallet wrapping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day &amp; Night Cycle</strong> \u2013 Adapt to changing work conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends to tackle huge orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your uncle has left you in charge of his Fulfillment center while he jet's off to who knows where!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with $10,000 and a pallet of salt, you're a highly important link in the local supply line!\u00a0 Your uncle left you with direct connections to various suppliers and a couple of clients that need your help!\u00a0 <br><br>Organize orders from Clients, manage your Fulfillment centers inventory, and make sure the shipments are sent on time in Fulfillment Center Simulator!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Warehouse</strong> \u2013 Start with a single pallet and grow into a fulfillment powerhouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Process &amp; Ship Orders</strong> \u2013 Pick, pack, and deliver shipments efficiently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Pallet Handling</strong> \u2013 Stack, wrap, and manage pallets with physics-based mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Automate</strong> \u2013 Invest in equipment to boost efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Your Business</strong> \u2013 Track expenses, profits, and customer renown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Layout</strong> \u2013 Organize shelves, workstations, and storage areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games &amp; Challenges</strong> \u2013 Engage in interactive tasks like pallet wrapping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day &amp; Night Cycle</strong> \u2013 Adapt to changing work conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends to tackle huge orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Your uncle has left you with $10,000, a pallet of salt, and a dream. Can you turn that into pure profit and become the kingpin of logistics?",
